{"version":1,"sig":"encyclopedia:v1","entries":{"wikipedia:zh:-:特朗普第二届任期关税":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"特朗普第二届任期关税","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%9C%97%E6%99%AE%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%B1%8A%E4%BB%BB%E6%9C%9F%E5%85%B3%E7%A8%8E","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:01.065Z","pageTitle":"特朗普第二届任期关税","extract":"唐納·川普在其第二屆美國總統任期內實施了一系列的關稅加徵措施，尤以2025年4月2日宣布的「對等關稅」（英語：Reciprocal Tariff）對全球金融市場衝擊最甚。川普長期以來一直提倡課徵進口關稅，作為談判交易和報復他認為「剝削」美國的國家的手段。川普的第二屆任期關稅反映了美國貿易保護主義政策的升級。雖然川普的第一屆政府對約3800億美元的進口商品課徵了關稅，但預計到2025年4月，他的第二屆政府課徵的關稅總額將超過1.4兆美元。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/President_Trump_Participates_in_the_Make_America_Wealthy_Again_Event_%281080p_30fps_H264-128kbit_AAC%29.webm/960px--President_Trump_Participates_in_the_Make_America_Wealthy_Again_Event_%281080p_30fps_H264-128kbit_AAC%29.webm.jpg","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":360},"wikipedia:ja:-:アイドルマスター シンデレラガールズ スターライトステージ":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"アイドルマスター シンデレラガールズ スターライトステージ","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89%E3%83%AB%E3%83%9E%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC_%E3%82%B7%E3%83%B3%E3%83%87%E3%83%AC%E3%83%A9%E3%82%AC%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BA_%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A9%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%82%B9%E3%83%86%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B8","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:01.835Z","pageTitle":"アイドルマスター シンデレラガールズ スターライトステージ","extract":"『アイドルマスター シンデレラガールズ スターライトステージ』（THE IDOLM@STER CINDERELLA GIRLS STARLIGHT STAGE）は、バンダイナムコエンターテインメントからAndroid/iOS用に配信されている音楽ゲームアプリ。2015年9月3日にAndroid版、同年9月10日にiOS版がリリースされた。略称は『デレステ』。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:zh:-:肥皂泡":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"肥皂泡","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%82%A5%E7%9A%82%E6%B3%A1","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:02.815Z","pageTitle":"肥皂泡","extract":"肥皂泡是肥皂產生的一種非常薄的虹彩的表面膜。肥皂泡的存在時間通常很短，它們會因觸碰其它物體或維持於空氣中太久而破裂（地心吸力令肥皂泡上方的膜變薄）。肥皂泡還可能幫助解決空間的複雜的數學問題，因為他們總是會找到點或者邊之間的最小表面。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/94/Reflection_in_a_soap_bubble_edit.jpg/960px-Reflection_in_a_soap_bubble_edit.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":472},"wikipedia:zh:-:猎户座流星雨":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"猎户座流星雨","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%8C%8E%E6%88%B7%E5%BA%A7%E6%B5%81%E6%98%9F%E9%9B%A8","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:03.341Z","pageTitle":"猎户座流星雨","extract":"獵戶座流星雨是發生在10月至11月初的流星雨，高峰期出現在10月21至22日，每小時約可以觀測到60顆來自獵戶座靠近雙子座邊緣輻射點的流星。不同於其他的流星雨，獵戶座流星雨在極大期的10月21至22日前後幾天都能夠見到，且來自輻射點的流星每小時大約仍有5至10顆。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Orionid12n.jpg/960px-Orionid12n.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":427},"wikipedia:zh:-:仙女座":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"仙女座","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BB%99%E5%A5%B3%E5%BA%A7","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:03.864Z","pageTitle":"仙女座","extract":"仙女座，88個現代星座之一，也是2世紀希臘羅馬天文學家托勒密列出的48個星座之一，位於天球赤道以北。在希臘神話中，仙女座象徵被拴在岩石上待海怪刻托吞噬的女神安朵美達。仙女座在北半球秋季夜晚最易觀賞，同時出現的還有象徵珀耳修斯神話中其他神祇的星座。由於其赤緯偏北，仙女座只有在南緯40度線以北的地區能夠看到，在40度以南的地區則會位於地平線之下。仙女座是天球上最大的星座之一，面積為722平方度，即是滿月大小的1400倍，最大星座長蛇座面積的55%，亦是最小星座南十字座面積的十倍以上。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/87/Andromeda_IAU.svg/960px-Andromeda_IAU.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":602},"wikipedia:en:-:Digital Millennium Copyright Act":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"en","variant":"","title":"Digital Millennium Copyright Act","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digital_Millennium_Copyright_Act","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"英文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:04.637Z","pageTitle":"Digital Millennium Copyright Act","extract":"The Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) is a 1998 United States copyright law that implements two 1996 treaties of the World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO). It criminalizes production and dissemination of technology, devices, or services intended to circumvent measures that control access to copyrighted works (commonly known as digital rights management or DRM). It also criminalizes the act of circumventing an access control, whether or not there is actual infringement of copyright itself. In addition, the DMCA heightens the penalties for copyright infringement on the Internet. Passed on October 12, 1998, by a unanimous vote in the United States Senate and signed into law by President Bill Clinton on October 28, 1998, the DMCA amended Title 17 of the United States Code to extend the reach of copyright, while limiting the liability of the providers of online services for copyright infringement by their users.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5c/Great_Seal_of_the_United_States_%28obverse%29.svg/960px-Great_Seal_of_the_United_States_%28obverse%29.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":640},"wikipedia:ja:-:クロス探偵物語":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"クロス探偵物語","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AF%E3%83%AD%E3%82%B9%E6%8E%A2%E5%81%B5%E7%89%A9%E8%AA%9E","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:05.140Z","pageTitle":"クロス探偵物語","extract":"『クロス探偵物語〜もつれた7つのラビリンス〜』（クロスたんていものがたり - もつれたななつのらびりんす）は、ワークジャムが開発し、デジタル・トウキョー、プランプランから発売されたセガサターン用ゲームソフト。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:ja:-:テイルズ オブ レジェンディア":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"テイルズ オブ レジェンディア","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%86%E3%82%A4%E3%83%AB%E3%82%BA_%E3%82%AA%E3%83%96_%E3%83%AC%E3%82%B8%E3%82%A7%E3%83%B3%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%A2","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:05.649Z","pageTitle":"テイルズ オブ レジェンディア","extract":"『テイルズ オブ レジェンディア』（Tales of Legendia、略称：TOL / レジェンディア）は、ナムコが2005年8月25日に発売したPlayStation 2用RPG。『テイルズ オブ』シリーズの1つで、シリーズ内で作品ごとに掲示されるジャンル名称は「絆が伝説を紡ぎだすRPG」。開発はこれまでのシリーズとは異なるスタッフにより新規に編成されたプロジェクトチーム・メルフェスにより行われ、様々な違いから従来作とは全体的な雰囲気を異なるものとしている。ストーリーは「絆」をテーマとしており、街や遺跡を有し島ほどの大きさを持つ巨大な船「遺跡船」を舞台に、主人公の少年セネルがヒロインの少女シャーリィを巡る勢力同士の戦いや2つの種族の対立を描く「メインシナリオ」全7章と、セネルおよびシャーリィ以外のパーティーキャラクターたちに焦点を当てた物語「キャラクタークエスト」全6話が展開される。戦闘システムはこれまでと同じくアクションゲームのような操作性だが、本作ではアクションが苦手でも簡単に楽しめるシンプルなものとなっている。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:ja:-:艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%89%A6%E9%9A%8A%E3%81%93%E3%82%8C%E3%81%8F%E3%81%97%E3%82%87%E3%82%93_-%E8%89%A6%E3%81%93%E3%82%8C-","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:06.166Z","pageTitle":"艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-","extract":"『艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-』（かんたいこれくしょん かんこれ）は、角川ゲームス（2016年まで）、『「艦これ」運営鎮守府』こと株式会社C2プレパラートが開発し、DMM系列のEXNOAが提供する『DMM GAMES』プラットフォーム上で、ブラウザゲームとして配信している日本の育成シミュレーションゲームおよび、そのメディアミックス作品群。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Handa_building_2019.jpg/960px-Handa_building_2019.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":908},"wikipedia:zh:-:艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%89%A6%E9%9A%8ACollection","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:10.517Z","pageTitle":"艦隊Collection","extract":"《艦隊Collection -艦Colle-》（日語：艦隊これくしょん -艦これ-），一般譯作「艦隊收藏」，是由角川遊戲開發、DMM提供及營運的網頁遊戲，簡稱《艦Colle》（艦これ）。本遊戲以第二次世界大戰時期的各國軍艦（以大日本帝國海軍為多數）為題材，而遊戲內容為玩家需要收集稱為「艦娘」（かんむす）的軍艦萌擬人化角色卡片，為艦娘進行強化及改造同時，並以在戰鬥中打倒敵人作為目標。作為PC瀏覽器運行的網頁遊戲，在營運半年用戶即突破100萬。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:en:-:Cute aggression":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"en","variant":"","title":"Cute aggression","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cute_aggression","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"英文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:11.620Z","pageTitle":"Cute aggression","extract":"Cute aggression, also known as gigil, cuteness aggression, or playful aggression, is the urge to squeeze, bite, or otherwise act aggressively toward things perceived as being cute without the desire to cause any harm. It is a common type of dimorphous display, where a person experiences positive and negative expressions simultaneously in a disorganised manner. Individuals experiencing cute aggression may find themselves clenching their jaw or fists, with the urge to squish, pinch, or bite an adorable baby, animal, or object. About half of adults report experiencing cute aggression.","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Juvenile_Ragdoll.jpg/960px-Juvenile_Ragdoll.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":576},"wikipedia:ja:-:足長手長":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"足長手長","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B6%B3%E9%95%B7%E6%89%8B%E9%95%B7","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:12.340Z","pageTitle":"足長手長","extract":"足長手長（あしながてなが）は、中国および日本に伝わる妖怪。1種のみの妖怪ではなく、足長人（あしながじん）と手長人（てながじん）の2種の総称である。","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Kuniyoshi_Ashinagatenaga.jpg?utm_source=ja.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","imageWidth":360,"imageHeight":526},"wikipedia:ja:-:手長足長":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"手長足長","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%89%8B%E9%95%B7%E8%B6%B3%E9%95%B7","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:12.849Z","pageTitle":"手長足長","extract":"手長足長（てながあしなが）は、秋田県、山形県、福島県、長野県、福井県などに伝わる伝説・昔話に登場する巨人。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:zh:-:白鹡鸰":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"白鹡鸰","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%99%BD%E9%B9%A1%E9%B8%B0","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:13.007Z","pageTitle":"白鹡鸰","extract":"白鶺鴒（學名：Motacilla alba），是一種鶺鴒科鶺鴒屬的一種小型鳥類，該物種主要分布於古北界的大部分歐洲、亞洲地區以及部分北非地區；在阿拉斯加西部也有少量繁殖。牠在棲息範圍內的溫暖地區定居，但在其他地方會遷徙至非洲。總共有9至11個M. alba的亞種；在愛爾蘭與大不列顛，黑背的亞種被稱為斑鶺鴒 \"pied wagtail\" （M. a. yarrellii）。","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/White_wagtail-_%28Non-breeding-_leucopsis_race%29_at_Kolkata_I_IMG_9947.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","imageWidth":800,"imageHeight":533},"wikipedia:ko:-:슈퍼비트: 소닉":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ko","variant":"","title":"슈퍼비트: 소닉","url":"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%8A%88%ED%8D%BC%EB%B9%84%ED%8A%B8%3A_%EC%86%8C%EB%8B%89","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"韓文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:14.288Z","pageTitle":"슈퍼비트: 소닉","extract":"슈퍼비트: 소닉(Superbeat: Xonic)은 누리조이가 개발하여 SCEK가 배급하는 플레이스테이션 비타 전용 리듬 게임이다. 2015년 10월 22일에 발매되었다. BEATCRAFT CYCLON에 이어 두 번째로 만드는 리듬 게임이자 누리조이 최초의 PS VITA 게임이며, DJMAX 포터블 시리즈, 테크니카 튠의 정신적 후속작이다.","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:en:-:Superbeat: Xonic":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"en","variant":"","title":"Superbeat: Xonic","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superbeat%3A_Xonic","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"英文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:14.792Z","pageTitle":"Superbeat: Xonic","extract":"Superbeat: Xonic (Korean: 슈퍼비트: 소닉) is a 2015 rhythm game for the PlayStation Vita; PlayStation 4, Xbox One and Nintendo Switch as Superbeat: Xonic EX in 2017 developed by Nurijoy, a company formed by former employees of Pentavision. The game is published by Sony Computer Entertainment Korea in South Korea, in Japan, PM Studios in conjunction with Acttil in North America, and by Rising Star Games in Europe with a release date of Q4 2015 worldwide. It is considered a spiritual successor to the DJMax music game series and its gameplay is based on the 2014 arcade game Beatcraft Cyclon, also made by Nurijoy.","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:en:-:Santa Lucia /(song/)":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"en","variant":"","title":"Santa Lucia /(song/)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Lucia_%2F(song%2F)","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"英文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:15.277Z","missing":true},"wikipedia:en:-:Santa Lucia":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"en","variant":"","title":"Santa Lucia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Lucia","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"英文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:15.773Z","pageTitle":"Santa Lucia","extract":"Santa Lucia may refer to:","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:ja:-:吾妻":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"吾妻","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%BE%E5%A6%BB","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:16.271Z","pageTitle":"吾妻","extract":"吾妻","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:ko:-:펜타비전":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ko","variant":"","title":"펜타비전","url":"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%8E%9C%ED%83%80%EB%B9%84%EC%A0%84","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"韓文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:17.076Z","pageTitle":"펜타비전","extract":"펜타비전 엔터테인먼트(Pentavision Entertainment)는 대한민국의 PC 온라인/휴대용 콘솔게임 개발업체이다. 2004년 어뮤즈월드의 EZ2DJ 개발팀 멤버 일부에 의해 설립된 후, 디제이맥스 온라인을 넷마블을 통해 출시해 활동을 시작했다. 2006년 네오위즈에 인수합병된 후 네오위즈 게임즈의 개발 스튜디오로서 PC 온라인 및 휴대용 콘솔게임을 내놓았다.","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/Neowiz_MUCA_logo.jpg?utm_source=ko.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","imageWidth":500,"imageHeight":500},"wikipedia:ko:-:PlanetBoom":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ko","variant":"","title":"PlanetBoom","url":"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/PlanetBoom","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"韓文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:17.578Z","pageTitle":"PlanetBoom","extract":"PlanetBoom(함경민)은 펜타비전에서 사운드 프로듀서를 맡고 있는 대한민국의 게임 음악 작곡가이다. 이전에 Winter Green라는 인디 밴드에서 활동하다가 활동이 중지되자 게임 음악 작곡가로 전향했다. 2009년 3월 7일 Miya(이행미)와 결혼 한다는 소식을 발표했다.","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:en:-:DJMax Respect":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"en","variant":"","title":"DJMax Respect","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DJMax_Respect","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"英文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:18.072Z","pageTitle":"DJMax Respect","extract":"DJMax Respect is a Korean-language rhythm game developed by Rocky Studio and Neowiz MUCA and published by Neowiz Games. It is the latest installment in the DJMax series. It was released for the PlayStation 4 in 2017, for Microsoft Windows in 2020, and Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S in 2022 as part of ID@Xbox. In Japan, the game was published by Arc System Works.","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:ja:-:DJMAX":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"ja","variant":"","title":"DJMAX","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/DJMAX","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"日文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:18.585Z","pageTitle":"DJMAX","extract":"『DJMAX』（ディージェイマックス）は、韓国のゲーム製作会社PENTAVISION、NEOWIZの音楽ゲームシリーズの総称。「DJ」と「MAX」の間に半角スペースが入ることもある。PENTAVISION消滅後は合併先のNEOWIZによって開発・販売が行われている。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:zh:-:Google Play":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"Google Play","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google_Play","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:24.243Z","pageTitle":"Google Play","extract":"Google Play又稱Play 商店，前身為Android Market。是由Google為Android作業系統所開發的行動應用程式數位發行平台，同時也是數字娛樂品牌。它作為Android作業系統的官方應用商店，允許使用者瀏覽和下載使用Android SDK開發並透過Google發布的應用程式。 Google Play也是數位媒體商店，提供音樂，雜誌，書籍，電影和電視節目。它之前提供了Google硬體裝置，直到2015年3月11日推出一個單獨的線上硬體零售商Google Store。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:zh:-:軟件開發":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"軟件開發","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BD%AF%E4%BB%B6%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:25.660Z","pageTitle":"软件开发","extract":"軟體開發（英語：Software development）是設計、建立、測試和維護軟體應用程式以滿足特定使用者需求或業務目標的過程。軟體開發的範疇超越了單純的編程或編寫原始碼，涵蓋了構想目標、評估可行性、分析軟體需求、設計、測試與發布等完整環節。該過程是軟體工程的組成部分，後者還包括組織管理、專案管理與組態管理等內容。","image":"","imageWidth":0,"imageHeight":0},"wikipedia:zh:-:Google":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"Google","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Google","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:32.627Z","pageTitle":"Google","extract":"Google（中文譯名：谷歌）是總部位於美國加州山景城的跨國科技公司，為Alphabet（字母控股）的子公司，業務範圍涵蓋網際網路廣告、網際網路搜尋、雲端運算、人工智慧等領域，開發並提供大量基於網際網路的產品與服務，其主要利潤來自Ads和AdSense等廣告服務。Google為北美4大雲端服務提供者（CSP）之一。Google由在史丹佛大學攻讀理工博士的賴利·佩吉和謝爾蓋·布林共同建立，因此兩人也被稱為「Google Guys」。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/32/Googleplex_HQ_%28cropped%29.jpg/960px-Googleplex_HQ_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":468},"wikipedia:zh:-:作業系統":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"作業系統","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:34.522Z","pageTitle":"操作系统","extract":"作業系統（英語：Operating system，operations system，operation system，縮寫：OS）是一組主管並控制電腦操作、運用和執行硬體、軟體資源和提供公共服務來組織使用者互動的相互關聯的系統軟體程式，同時也是電腦系統的核心與基石。作業系統需要處理如管理與組態主記憶體、決定系統資源供需的優先次序、控制輸入與輸出裝置、操作網路與管理檔案系統等基本事務。作業系統也提供一個讓使用者與系統互動的操作介面。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Operating_system_architecture.svg/960px-Operating_system_architecture.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":393},"wikipedia:zh:-:Android":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"Android","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/Android","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:41.389Z","pageTitle":"Android","extract":"Android（[ˈænˌdrɔɪd]），是一個基於Linux核心與其他開源軟體的開放原始碼的行動作業系統，由Google成立的開放手機聯盟持續領導與開發。中文常用非官方音譯為「安卓系統」，也有報道引述曾註冊過「安致」可能作為其中文商標。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Android_logo_2023_%28stacked%29.svg/960px-Android_logo_2023_%28stacked%29.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":392},"wikipedia:zh:-:網站":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"網站","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%B6%B2%E7%AB%99","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:41.907Z","pageTitle":"網站","extract":"網站是指在全球資訊網上，根據一定的規則，使用HTML等工具製作的用於展示特定內容的相關網頁的集合。簡單地說，網站是一種通訊工具，就像布告欄一樣，人們可以通過網站來發布自己想要公開的資訊，或網站來提供相關的網路服務。人們可以通過網頁瀏覽器來訪問網站，獲取自己需要的資訊或者享受網路服務。","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Www.wikipedia_screenshot_%282021%29.png/960px-Www.wikipedia_screenshot_%282021%29.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","imageWidth":640,"imageHeight":694},"wikipedia:zh:-:CyanogenMod":{"provider":"wikipedia","lang":"zh","variant":"","title":"CyanogenMod","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/CyanogenMod","siteLabel":"維基百科","langLabel":"中文","sig":"encyclopedia:v1","fetchedAt":"2026-11-06T18:55:44.357Z","pageTitle":"CyanogenMod","extract":"CyanogenMod（/saɪ.ˈæn.oʊ.ˌdʒɛn.mɒd/；縮寫作「CM」）是一個已停止開發的Linux發行版作業系統，主要供平板電腦及智慧型手機使用。它是基於Google釋出的Android原始碼而開發的自由及開放原始碼